<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman starts Halifax.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman starts Halifax.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Halifax Plc was rated &quot;market underperformer&quot; as Goldman Sachs started coverage of the banking group, which made its market debut on Monday, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>The stock was down 14-1/2p at 720 by 1029 GMT in volume of 9.7 million shares.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
